quran[7]{c,v,t}:
  5,58,"When you call to the prayer, they take it as mockery and play. That is because they are people who do not understand."
  5,59,"Say: ‘O People of the Book! Are you seeking revenge against us only because we believe in Allah, and (we believe in) what has been revealed to us, and what was revealed before, whereas most of you are disobedient?’"
  5,60,"Say: ‘Shall I inform you of something worse than that (punishment) as a requital from Allah? (It is those) whom Allah has cursed, and upon whom He brought His wrath. He turned some of them into apes and swine and (also) the worshipers of idols (i.e. the slaves of Satan). These are in a far worse situation and more astray from the right way.’"
  5,61,"When they come to you, they say: ‘We believe.’ Indeed, they enter with disbelief and certainly leave with it. And Allah knows best what they have been hiding."
  5,62,"You see many of them hastening actively into sin and enmity and consuming illicit gains. Indeed, evil is what they have been doing."
  5,63,"Why do the rabbis and scholars not forbid them from their sinful speech and their consumption of illicit gains? Indeed, evil is what they have been doing."
  5,64,"The Jews say: ‘Allah’s hand is tied up (with miserliness and helplessness).’ Tied up are their hands, and they are cursed for what they say! Instead, His hands are wide open. He bestows (as much) as He pleases. What has been revealed to you from your Lord will surely increase many of them in rebellion and disbelief. And We have cast between them enmity and hatred till the Day of Resurrection. Whenever they kindle a fire for war, Allah extinguishes it. They seek to cause corruption on the earth, and Allah does not like the corruptors."
